    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Dream Stability.</strong> Repeated exposure to dream-currents and metaphysical imagery has toughened your inner life.</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to Soul check.</li><li>When confronted with illusions, psychic assaults, or overwhelming symbolism, the GM may grant you reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being charmed or Shaken.</li><li>Bad Eden systems may treat you as an anchor for sanity and cohesion in high-weirdness hexes, Sparks, and encounters.</li></ul>",
